<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for applying to Arizona State University! My name is {!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}, and I will be your personal admission counselor. I am here to help you through the admission process and answer any questions you may have.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Your next steps for admission</b>&nbsp;</font></div><div><ol><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Activate your <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> account to check the status of your application and view <b>Priority Task</b> items you need to complete, such as paying your application fee.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Submit your ACT or SAT scores to be automatically considered for ASU’s merit-based scholarships. We accept scores sent directly from the testing centers using the ASU school code 4007 for <a href="https://www.collegeboard.org/">SAT</a> or 0088 for <a href="http://www.act.org/content/act/en/products-and-services/the-act.html">ACT</a>.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">View a full list of <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/requirements#application-steps">next steps</a> online.</span></li></ol></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Once ASU has received your complete application, it will take about four to six weeks to receive your admission decision. Be sure to regularly check your My ASU account for updates.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Explore more</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Use the <a href="https://scholarships.asu.edu/estimator">Scholarship Estimator</a> to see if you may be eligible for an automatic merit-based scholarship.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The <a href="https://scholarships.asu.edu/">ASU Scholarship portal</a> is now accepting 2017–2018 applications. The majority of the scholarships have a deadline from Jan. 1 through March 1, so use your time wisely.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Five tips for navigating the scholarship portal:</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Use one filter at a time. Entering multiple filters will limit the scholarship search.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Scholarships with a maroon portal application button are only available to ASU students, which reduces the pool of applicants you’re up against, and it will save your essay responses from application to application.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Check out <a href="https://scholarships.asu.edu/colleges">College Listings</a> for links to additional ASU scholarships beyond what are listed on the portal.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">When in doubt — always apply.</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We highly encourage you to schedule a <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/">campus visit</a> to learn more about your future campus home. This is truly the best way to determine if ASU is the right fit for you.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions about the admission process or ASU in general, please don't hesitate to contact me directly.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>